 facilities. Such map shall show:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"83289a3a-91d5-5cf6-aa8a-f37818848d3c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.100","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.100","content_hash":"d32c436840d66225690b8de3a1f0727ea4ef28e554751ab8cbdd1c87e3587b90","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.100:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.100:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.100","text":"(a) The name of the property owner of adjacent land that is not subdivided;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"75684de2-392a-5a0b-91dd-8c312f98d638"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.100","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.100","content_hash":"aca04305ba04614aa60bca1c75b2935735054f136293536c22b73380bd77bcff","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.100:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.100:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.100","text":"(b) Location and name of adjoining subdivisions;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"245e84a5-80fd-5dac-9d4f-a96f9040edf5"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.100","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.100","content_hash":"2d7debfe5fcb1cd4b448098fb61754ea704e22573c73cd7a06be72acc5a60ce0","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.100:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.100:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.100","text":"(c) Location and size of water and sewer lines;","type":"paragraph","workb